格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A public gallery of animated pets for Codex, Claude Code, DeepSeek Harness, Hermes, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, and more.","id":"gh:1227102698","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"petdex","slug":"crafter-station/petdex","topics":["claude-code","clerk","cli","codex","developer-tools","drizzle-orm","dsh-plugin","mascot","neon","nextjs","pixel-art","postgres","react","sprites","tailwindcss","vercel"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A public gallery of animated pets for Codex, Claude Code, DeepSeek Harness, Hermes, OpenCode, Gemini"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"y of animated pets for Codex, Claude Code, DeepSeek Harness, Hermes, OpenCode, Gemini CLI, and more."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"Petdex"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"The public gallery of animated companions for Codex."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Browse, install, and submit pets with one command."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"petdex.dev"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Built with Petdex"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"Discord"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"npm"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## What is Petdex"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Petdex is three things working together:"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. **A web gallery** at petdex.dev where the community submits, reviews, and showcases animated pets"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" in the Codex sprite format.\n2. **A CLI** that installs any pet on your machine with one command and"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" ships them straight into Codex.\n3. **A desktop app** that floats a pet on your screen and reacts to"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" your coding agent's activity in real time."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Every pet is a folder. Every folder is a Pokédex entry. Every entry is one `npx petdex install` away"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"very pet is a folder. Every folder is a Pokédex entry. Every entry is one `npx petdex install` away."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Follow this checklist to get a pet installed, visible in Codex, and connected to the desktop app."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. Install a known pet:"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"You should see `~/.petdex/pets/boba/` with `pet.json` and a spritesheet."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"2. Get the desktop app from petdex.dev/download. It\nruns on macOS, Linux and Windows."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"3. Open it, then hit Cmd+, over the pet to open Settings.\nPick your pet under **Pets**, and connect "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"your coding agents under **Agents**\nwith one click each. No terminal involved."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"The pet floats above your workspace and animates on every tool call your agent\nmakes."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Signed-in creators can also group approved pets into personal collections from\nthe profile's **Colle"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"ctions** tab or the CLI:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## For users"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| You want to... | Do this |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Browse pets | Visit petdex.dev |\n| Install a pet | `npx petdex install <slug>` |\n| Switch active m"},{"id":"p25s2","text":"ascot | Open Settings in the desktop app (Cmd+,) |\n| Run the desktop floater | Download it from petd"},{"id":"p25s3","text":"ex.dev/download |\n| Make a pet | Use the `hatch-pet` skill inside Codex, or build one with the Petde"},{"id":"p25s4","text":"x creator tools |\n| Submit a pet | `npx petdex submit ./my-pet/` or drop it through the web submitte"},{"id":"p25s5","text":"r |\n| Manage collections | `npx petdex collection list` or use the Collections tab on your profile |"},{"id":"p25s6","text":"\n| Join the community | Discord |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Full CLI reference: `packages/petdex-cli/README.md`."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Personal collections are limited to 10 per account. The 24-pet limit bounds\ngrowth rather than the s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"tored row, so a collection created before it existed can\nstill be renamed or shrunk, but not grown. "},{"id":"p27s3","text":"The CLI supports listing, creating,\nediting, deleting, and JSON output for automation."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## For builders"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"If you want to build on top of Petdex (a desktop client, a wearable, an SDK, a Discord bot, anything"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"), you have two stable surfaces:"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"- **The HTTP API.** `petdex.dev/api/manifest` returns every approved pet with its slug, spritesheet "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"URL, animation states, and metadata.\n- **The pet package format.** Every pet is a `pet.json` plus a "},{"id":"p30s3","text":"`spritesheet.{webp,png}` rendered as an 8x9 grid of 192x208 frames, or the v2 8x11 grid."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"21 open-source and source-available projects already build on these. See petdex.dev/built-with for t"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"he catalog, then submit yours via the issue template."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Architecture"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"**Web stack**: Next.js 16, React 19, Tailwind, Drizzle, Postgres, Redis, Clerk, R2."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"**CLI**: Bun + TypeScript, ships as a single npm binary. Auth via Clerk OAuth + PKCE."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"**Desktop**: Native SDK app with an in-process Zig hook server on `127.0.0.1:7777`. The current rele"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"ase path has no WebView or Node sidecar."},{"id":"p37s1","text":"## Develop locally"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"Two paths are supported."},{"id":"p39s1","text":"| Goal | Command | Setup |"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"| Local full stack | `bun run dev:docker` | Docker or Podman, ~30s warm-up. |\n| Run against real ser"},{"id":"p40s2","text":"vices | `bun run dev` | `.env.local` filled (maintainers only). |"},{"id":"p41s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Open localhost:3000. Full guide in `CONTRIBUTING.md`."},{"id":"p43s1","text":"## Pet package format"},{"id":"p44s1","text":"Every pet is two files:"},{"id":"p45s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p46s1","text":"The native renderer supports nine state rows: `idle`, `running-right`, `running-left`, `waving`, `ju"},{"id":"p46s2","text":"mping`, `failed`, `waiting`, `running`, and `review`. Codex and the supported coding agents map thei"},{"id":"p46s3","text":"r activity hooks to these states. The v2 8x11 atlas leaves two additional rows available to the cons"},{"id":"p46s4","text":"oks to these states. The v2 8x11 atlas leaves two additional rows available to the consuming client."},{"id":"p47s1","text":"## Contribute"},{"id":"p48s1","text":"- **Submit a pet:** petdex.dev/submit or `npx petdex submit <path>`.\n- **List your project:** open a"},{"id":"p48s2","text":" Built with Petdex issue.\n- **Fix a bug or add a feature:** read `CONTRIBUTING.md`, then open a PR.\n"},{"id":"p48s3","text":"- **Hang out:** Discord has channels for shipping (`#wip`, `#ship-or-sink`), feedback (`#cli-feedbac"},{"id":"p48s4","text":"k`), and showcases (`#showcase`)."},{"id":"p49s1","text":"## Pet IP and takedowns"},{"id":"p50s1","text":"Pets are user-submitted fan art. Petdex does not claim rights to any underlying IP. If you hold righ"},{"id":"p50s2","text":"ts to a character and want a pet removed, file a takedown request and we review within 48 hours."},{"id":"p51s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p52s1","text":"The source code is MIT. Pet assets are owned by their submitters under whatever license they choose "},{"id":"p52s2","text":"code is MIT. Pet assets are owned by their submitters under whatever license they choose to declare."},{"id":"p53s1","text":"Made by Crafter Station.\nLead: @RaillyHugo."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
